flowchart TD
    A["1. Field Imagery Collection<br/><i>108 Raw Frames across 10 Corridors in Ward 29</i><br/>[COMPLETED]"] --> B["2. Metadata Auditing & Deduplication<br/><i>Corridor Assignment ST01 - ST10 & EXIF Verification</i><br/>[COMPLETED]"]
    
    B --> C["3. Define 12 Urban Asset Classes<br/><i>building, electric_pole, streetlight, commercial_sign,<br/>traffic_signal, road_sign, transformer, drain, sidewalk,<br/>waste_bin, bus_stop, other_urban_asset</i><br/>[COMPLETED]"]
    
    C --> D["4. Bounding Box Annotation<br/><i>Drawing ground-truth boxes in YOLO format</i><br/>[ONGOING WORK]"]
    
    D --> E["5. Annotation Quality Review & Class Harmonization<br/><i>Verify consistency, remove overlapping duplicate boxes</i><br/>[IN PROGRESS]"]
    
    E --> F["6. Corridor-Stratified Dataset Split<br/><i>Train: 84 frames | Val: 18 frames | Test: 6 frames</i><br/>[COMPLETED]"]
    
    F --> G["7. YOLO11 Model Training<br/><i>Epochs: 50-100, Imgsz: 640, Batch: 16<br/>Runs on GPU: Google Colab T4 / Local PyTorch</i><br/>[IN PROGRESS]"]
    
    G --> H["8. Model Validation & Metric Logging<br/><i>Evaluate mAP50, mAP50-95, Precision, Recall<br/>Logged in runs/detect/val-1 to val-34</i><br/>[COMPLETED]"]
    
    H --> I{"Accuracy & Generalization<br/>Meets Target Criteria?<br/>(mAP50 >= 0.70 on unseen streets)"}
    
    I -- No --> J["9. Error Analysis & Active Feedback<br/><i>Identify false positives, hard negatives, occlusions</i><br/>[ONGOING]"]
    J --> D
    
    I -- Yes --> K["10. Export Best Production Weights<br/><i>best.pt (PyTorch) & best.onnx (Optimized)</i><br/>[COMPLETED]"]
    
    K --> L["11. Deploy into FastAPI Backend Service<br/><i>Integrated into /api/analyze-street endpoint</i><br/>[COMPLETED]"]

